  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-India Growth Opportunities Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Economics and Finance Team at the British High Commission, India has commissioned this study to map key drivers and barriers to mutual UK-India Growth. It involves analysis of present and future growth hotspots in India, map it to UK Industrial strategy (and other) sectors and key growth enablers to maximize bilateral trade and investment opportunities for inclusive growth in light of the recently signed UK-India CETA. The study will contribute to the UK government&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s bilateral engagement strategy in India in the identified geographies (States), focus on sectors of interest and underpin the Comprehensive Strategic Partnership in the long-term</narrative>
  </description>
